Flow Start free meditation
Id meditation.start-free

  Screen Choose focus
  Id meditation.choose-focus

    Shows
      Focus options

    Select focus
      Rules
        Focus must be one of Breathing, Visualization, Affirmation, Balanced

      Store selected focus
      Go to Choose voice

  Screen Choose voice
  Id meditation.choose-voice

    Shows
      Voice options
      Voice name for the held voice
      Voice description for the held voice

    Select voice
      If the voice requires Premium and the user has no Premium
        Go to Premium paywall

      Otherwise
        Store selected voice
        Go to Choose duration

    Hold voice
      Steps
        Mark the held voice for preview
      Outcome
        Voice preview details are available

  Screen Choose duration
  Id meditation.choose-duration

    Shows
      Duration options

    Select duration
      Store selected duration
      Go to Generate meditation

  Screen Premium paywall
  Id meditation.premium-paywall

    Shows
      Premium benefits
      Purchase options

  Action Generate meditation
  Id meditation.generate

    Receives
      Selected focus
      Selected voice
      Selected duration

    Steps
      Generate the meditation session

    Outcome
      Meditation is ready
